   - A state segmented toggle: Idle / Thinking / Happy. Set a data-state attribute
     on <body>; each design reacts (Thinking = faster pulse/spin, Happy = eyes
     squint into happy curves)
   - A size slider (44px–120px) that scales all avatars via a --s variable

4. Each card has a "Use in Nova" button that copies that single design's CSS +
   markup to the clipboard (with the currently-chosen colors baked into a :root
   block), so I can paste it straight into another file. Show a small toast on copy.

5. Dark theme, clean modern look: rounded cards, subtle borders, monospace labels.

Make it look polished, keep all CSS/JS inline in the one file, and after creating
it run the server and confirm the page loads at http://localhost:8088/avatar-lab.html.
